[[File:Bullying_on_Instituto_Regional_Federico_Errázuriz_(IRFE)_in_March_5,_2007.jpg|thumb|right|an example of bullying.]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ˈbʊl.i.ɪŋ/}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{af|en|bully|-ing|id2=gerund noun}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~}}

# An act of [[intimidating]] a person to do something, especially such [[repeated]] [[coercion]].
# Persistent acts intended to make life unpleasant for another person.
#: {{ux|en|'''Bullying''' is a punishable offense in schools.}}

